# Skills owned by the `skills` CLI, one entry each in .skill-lock.json.
# Restore with `skills experimental_install`; always pass -g in this repo,
# or the CLI installs into a nested .agents/skills/ instead.
# Local changes do not survive `skills update`: upstream a PR, or drop the
# skill from the lock to take ownership of it here.
